Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(diag): opt-in boot phase trace
 (SHARPEMU_BOOT_TRACE=1)

Prints /proc/uptime plus elapsed ms at each boot phase, and splits the HLE
warm-up into reflection, class constructors and PrepareMethod time, so a
boot can be lined up against a launcher's or bench script's clock. Free
when off.
